{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56118","headline":"步虚词 十一 · 杜光庭","name":"步虚词 十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蒙蒙如细雾，冉冉曳铢衣。\n妙逐祥烟上，轻随彩凤飞。\n几陪瑶室宴，忽指洞天归。\n伫立扶桑岸，高奔日帝晖。\n（同前。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56118.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56118","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}